OL,3,GNEWSAStorm-damaged airport roof repair
OL,4,Afunds agreed
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputies have agreed to spend up to
OL,7,F#6.1m to repair the roof of an airport
OL,8,Fterminal building.
OL,10,FGuernsey Airport was damaged by high
OL,11,Fwinds during several storms, which led
OL,12,Fto scaffolding being put up in 2025.
OL,14,FThe States' Trading Supervisory Board
OL,15,Fsaid "extensive structural repairs"
OL,16,Fcould take up to 18 months.
OL,18,FThe board wants repairs to begin by
OL,19,Fmid-2027 with a specific timeline and
OL,20,Fcosts to follow expressions of interest
OL,21,Ffor potential contractors.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
